SUMMARY:Live Music featuring Melanie Pearl at Flying Ace Farm
DESCRIPTION:LIVE MUSIC FEATURING VOCALIST MELANIE PEARL AT FLYING ACE FARM\nJoin us for live music on Sunday\, November 29th\, from 2-5pm\, featuring vocalist Melanie Pearl at Flying Ace Farm in Lovettsville\, Virginia.\nJoin us for live music at Flying Ace Farm on Sunday\, November 29th from 2–5 PM\, featuring Northern Virginia musician Melanie Pearl. Spend the afternoon enjoying handcrafted American Ace Spirits\, fresh BBQ\, locally brewed beer\, and scenic mountain views while listening to an entertaining mix of music spanning multiple decades. Admission is free\, and seating is available on a first-come\, first-served basis. \nAbout Melanie Pearl\nFor more than a decade\, Melanie Pearl has been entertaining audiences throughout the Shenandoah Valley with her engaging solo performances. Accompanied by her keyboard\, ukulele\, and vocals\, Melanie creates an interactive experience by tailoring each performance to the crowd and welcoming song requests. \nKnown for her versatile style\, Melanie performs a wide variety of popular hits from across the decades\, featuring music made famous by artists such as Janis Joplin\, Dolly Parton\, Amy Winehouse\, Adele\, and many more. Her ability to connect with audiences and deliver memorable performances has made her a favorite at venues throughout Northern Virginia\, including Barrel Oak Winery & Brewery\, The Half Note Lounge\, Woodstock Brewhouse\, and Bright Box. \nTo learn more about Melanie\, visit her official website. You can also find her on Facebook and YouTube \nBe sure to check out our full Live Music Schedule to see all upcoming performances at Flying Ace Farm.
URL:https://flyingacefarm.com/calendar/live-music-melanie-pearl/
LOCATION:Flying Ace Farm
CATEGORIES:Family,Kids,Live Music,local
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://flyingacefarm.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/Melanie-Pearl-musician.jpg
END:VEVENT
