SUMMARY:Live Music at Flying Ace Farm featuring Joey Hafner
DESCRIPTION:Live Music featuring local musician Joey Hafner at Flying Ace Farm\nJoin us on Sunday\, December 13th\, from 2-5PM for live music with Joey Hafner. \nJoey Hafner is a vocalist and guitar player based in Lovettsville\, Virginia\, delivering high-energy acoustic performances as a solo artist and as the front man of the party rock cover band Ghost Pepper. With a musical journey that began at age nine\, Joey was shaped by the alternative explosion of the 90s\, drawing early inspiration from bands like Jane’s Addiction\, Smashing Pumpkins\, and Pearl Jam. Known for engaging\, crowd-friendly sets\, Joey blends alternative rock\, 90s hip hop\, classic rock\, and country into performances built for wineries\, breweries\, and live entertainment venues throughout Northern Virginia and Central Maryland. His shows often feature creative mashups\, familiar sing-alongs\, and the occasional surprise throwback\, creating a fun\, energetic atmosphere that keeps audiences involved from start to finish. Whether performing solo\, or in a duo\, Joey brings professionalism\, versatility\, and genuine passion to every stage. \nJoey Hafner is a seasoned performer known for energetic acoustic sets throughout the region – learn more on his official Facebook page or his official Instagram page. \nBe sure to check out our full Live Music Schedule at Flying Ace Farm to see all upcoming performances. \n \n \n  \n 
URL:https://flyingacefarm.com/calendar/live-music-joey-hafner-2/
LOCATION:Flying Ace Farm
CATEGORIES:Family,Free Event,Live Music
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://flyingacefarm.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/att.X3fnWM3GloCKyNXVsjVNKQwb8h0gDGrZe9VPCb5TaEY.jpg
ORGANIZER;CN="Flying Ace Farm":MAILTO:info@flyingacefarm.com
