DESCRIPTION:Live Music at Flying Ace Farm featuring Alex Kerns\nJoin us on Sunday\, December 20th\, from 2-5pm for live music by Alex Kerns. \nBio:Known to genre bend\, Alex Kerns covers a wide range of artists and songs. From the classic sounds of the Beatles to Tyler Childers to the Americana vibe of his own originals. Hailing from Berryville\, Virginia\, Alex Kerns is the cofounder and bass player of the Low Water Bridge band. Alex Kerns is regionally well known and always leaves a smile on the faces of the fans and patrons that attend his shows.\n\nBorn and raised in Clarke County\, Virginia\, Alex Kern’s has been playing up and down the Shenandoah Valley for the past 15 years. He is currently the bass player for Low Water Bridge Band\, but also pursues a busy acoustic solo career. He’s played everywhere from small amphitheaters to small back yard private parties and always a perfect fit for just about any occasion.\nTo learn more about Alex Kerns and upcoming performances\, visit his official Facebook page. \nBe sure to check out our full Live Music Schedule at Flying Ace Farm to see all upcoming performances. \n \n \n  \n 
