SUMMARY:Live Music at Flying Ace Farm featuring Morgan Gonce
DESCRIPTION:Live Music at Flying Ace Farm featuring Morgan Gonce\nJoin us on Saturday\, December 26th\, from 3-6pm for live music featuring Morgan Gonce.\nMusician Bio:\nMorgan Gonce is a 19 year old award-winning guitarist\, producer\, and singer-songwriter from Baltimore\, Maryland. Morgan’s guitar playing ranges from R&B\, folk\, pop\, rock\, and indie influences while implementing her emotional and soulful touch to whatever gig she is called for. \nCurrently in her fourth semester\, Morgan is a Presidential Scholarship awardee from Berklee College of Music\, and is double majoring in Independent Recording & Production and Guitar Performance. After Berklee\, Morgan’s future goals are to continue her career as be successful touring/studio guitarist and multi-genre producer\, as well as kickstarting her own music as an artist. \n*To learn more about Morgan Gonce and upcoming performances\, visit her Instagram page. \n**Be sure to check out our Live Music Schedule at Flying Ace Farm to see all upcoming performances. \n \n \n  \n 
URL:https://flyingacefarm.com/calendar/live-music-morgan-gonce-2/
LOCATION:Flying Ace Farm
